WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.317
Is the program virtual or
in person?

2
00:00:02.517 --> 00:00:03.943
It's virtual.

3
00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:05.919
That means you can join from

4
00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:09.085
anywhere: your office, your home,
or on the road.

5
00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:12.025
And virtual doesn't mean distant.

6
00:00:12.225 --> 00:00:14.387
Every live session is with a small

7
00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:16.395
group of leaders working on the

8
00:00:16.395 --> 00:00:18.480
same things you are, so you still

9
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.032
get the momentum, the insight and
the accountability.

10
00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:24.503
Wherever you are, you can
be part of it.
